          %h3#cohomology_2 Cohomology
          %p
            The
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/ordinary+cohomology"} ordinary cohomology
            of Eilenberg-MacLane spaces is discussed in
          %ul
            %li#Clement02
              Alain Clément,
